      {
        question: "狭缝模头宽高比 (W/H > 12:1) 与纤维各向异性指数 (AI) 的流变学物理原理是什么？",
        answer: "制造逼真的整块植物肉需要使混乱无序的菌丝浆料在流道内单向拉伸取向，模拟哺乳动物的骨骼肌纤维束。这一过程由恒温控制的长矩形冷却狭缝模头实现，该模头具有极高的截面宽高比（W/H > 12:1）与超长冷却段（1,200至2,400 mm）。在层流剪切流场下，模壁剪切速率公式为 γ̇_wall = (6 · Q) / (W · H^2)。熔融状态的微蛋白物料进入狭缝模头后，速度梯度的拉伸剪切使柔性菌丝沿主流动方向高度定向排布。纤维各向异性指数（AI = F_垂直拉力 / F_平行拉力）量化了这一取向度：天然鸡胸肉的AI值约为2.8至3.4，而HSE-HCT系统实测AI达到3.15至3.65，证明形成了高度平行、清晰可辨的肉质纵向肌理。"
      },
      {
        question: "机筒至模头的温度梯度是如何防止物料发生闪蒸膨胀并固化定型肌肉纹理的？",
        answer: "在高水分挤压（含水率55%至75%）中，物料在双螺杆机筒内承受40至80 bar的高压，并在熔融区被加热至130–145°C。在此高温下，水分处于过热液体状态。如果直接喷入大气中，压力的瞬间骤降会导致水分子发生爆裂式闪蒸蒸发，使物料膨化成海绵状多孔膨化食品。长冷却狭缝模头内部装有逆流循环乙二醇夹套，作为连续热交换器将物料中心温度逐步降至75°C以下（远低于常压沸点），从而彻底抑制闪蒸膨胀。同时，降温促使蛋白发生折叠与二硫键重组，并诱导几丁质/葡聚糖微纤发生结晶，将取向一致的纤维束永久冻结锁定为多汁致密的整块人造肉。"
      },
      {
        question: "微蛋白相比传统养殖肉类及大豆植物肉有哪些营养与碳足迹优势？",
        answer: "Fusarium venenatum微蛋白通过气升式生物反应器在受控碳水化合物底物中进行连续好氧发酵生产。干基营养成分中含有约45%的完全蛋白质，包含全部九种人体必需氨基酸，蛋白质消化率校正氨基酸评分（PDCAAS）高达0.99（与牛奶和蛋清相当）。此外，其含有超过25%的膳食纤维（主要为益生元β-葡聚糖），胆固醇为零，饱和脂肪极低（<1.5%）。在生态环境方面，相比工业养牛，该技术节约高达98%的土地与90%的水资源，温室气体排放减少80%至92%（~0.6–0.8 kg CO2e/kg）。此外，得益于菌丝体葡聚糖天然优异的流变润滑性能，挤压比机械能比大豆高水分挤压降低39%（仅88.5 kWh/吨）。"
      },
      {
        question: "微蛋白的RNA脱除限制及高压挤压机组的工程安全规范有哪些？",
        answer: "Fusarium venenatum微蛋白已获得美国FDA 21 CFR § 170.36 GRAS认证（GRN 000091）。其关键生产安全控制在于热休克RNA脱除工序（68–72°C保温20分钟），利用内源真菌核糖核酸酶将未处理菌体中约10%的高浓度RNA降解至干基2.0%以下，彻底规避因嘌呤转化尿酸而引发的痛风和肾结石风险。在机械装备方面，双螺杆挤压机筒与空化单元设计耐压达180 bar，严格符合ASME锅炉与压力容器规范（BPVC）第VIII卷第1分卷，配备爆破片与超扭矩电子离合保护（<5.0 ms快速响应）。整线卫生设计满足3-A 60-01与EHEDG Class I标准，与物料接触面均经电解抛光（Ra ≤ 0.20 µm），支持全自动在线清洗（CIP）。"
      }
    ]
  }
};

const c = CONTENT[lang as Exclude<SupportedLanguage, 'en'>];

const breadcrumbs = [
  { label: t('nav.home') || 'Home', href: tp('/') },
  { label: t('nav.tools') || 'Tools', href: tp('/tools/') },
  { label: c.breadcrumbsLabel }
];

const structuredData = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "WebApplication",
      "@id": `https://isitkitchensafe.com/${lang}/tools/commercial-continuous-hse-hct-mycoprotein-texturizing-modeler/#webapp`,
      "url": `https://isitkitchensafe.com/${lang}/tools/commercial-continuous-hse-hct-mycoprotein-texturizing-modeler/`,
      "name": c.h1,
      "applicationCategory": "EngineeringApplication",
      "operatingSystem": "All",
      "browserRequirements": "Requires JavaScript. Requires HTML5 Canvas/CSS3.",
      "offers": {
        "@type": "Offer",
        "price": "0",
        "priceCurrency": "USD"
      },
      "description": c.pageDescription
    },
    {
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "itemListElement": [
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          "position": 1,
          "name": t('nav.home') || 'Home',
          "item": `https://isitkitchensafe.com${tp('/')}`
        },
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          "position": 2,
          "name": t('nav.tools') || 'Tools',
          "item": `https://isitkitchensafe.com${tp('/tools/')}`
        },
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          "position": 3,
          "name": c.breadcrumbsLabel,
          "item": `https://isitkitchensafe.com/${lang}/tools/commercial-continuous-hse-hct-mycoprotein-texturizing-modeler/`
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": c.faqs.map(faq => ({
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": faq.question,
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": faq.answer
        }
      }))
    }
  ]
};
---

<Layout title={c.pageTitle} description={c.pageDescription}>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(structuredData)} />

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 sm:py-12">
    <Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs} />

    <!-- Hero Header -->
    <div class="mb-10 text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-amber-950 text-amber-300 border border-amber-800 mb-4">
        <span>{c.badge}</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-ink tracking-tight mb-4 leading-tight">
        {c.h1}
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-muted leading-relaxed">
        {c.lead}
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Interactive Simulator Component -->
    <CommercialContinuousHseHctModeler lang={lang} />

    <!-- In-Depth Technical & Regulatory FAQs -->
    <div class="mt-16 bg-surface p-6 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl border border-hairline">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-2">Technical &amp; Regulatory Engineering FAQs</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted mb-8">Authoritative technical documentation on continuous twin-screw high-moisture extrusion, slit-die laminar orientation, hydrodynamic cavitation sub-cellular defibrillation, and food regulatory standards.</p>
      
      <div class="space-y-6">
        {c.faqs.map(faq => (
          <div class="border-b border-hairline/60 pb-6 last:border-b-0 last:pb-0">
            <h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">{faq.question}</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">{faq.answer}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
